{"c":[{"id":"262cf27713e88954","sum":"Warehouse ERD views are labeled with Mermaid entity aliases name[\"name (view)\"]: %% comments do not render in erDiagram boxes, so views (session_token_usage) need a visible label, pinned by a rendered-output contract.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T190402Z-6371376f562b82e0","text":"QA for warehouse-schema-docs failed: Mermaid %% view comment is invisible in rendered ERD, so session_token_usage is not visually distinguished from tables; Build must make views visibly labeled/styled and add a rendered-output contract.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T190854Z-e3140d8fbabc94db","text":"Warehouse ERD views use Mermaid entity aliases name[\"name (view)\"]; %% comments do not render in erDiagram boxes.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"f0937a1056310039","sum":"sr-query SKILL.md keeps meanings the ERD cannot show (thinking not captured, tool inputs only, project_id/cwd/workspace_key/entrypoint); stockroom install never writes user-level uv extra indexes that bleed into other projects' locks.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T192526Z-070c0a987fc44833","text":"sr-query: replacing the column catalog with the ERD dropped meanings the picture cannot show; keep thinking-not-captured, tool-inputs-only, and project_id/cwd/workspace_key/entrypoint in SKILL.md.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260913T191146Z-bac17d4e200b9c2d","text":"Stockroom install must not write user-level uv extra indexes that bleed into other projects' locks.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
